# Formatted by hand, not by Prettier: the Astro formatter restructures this
# file incorrectly (it moved </head> above the <title> and JSON-LD block, and
# </html> ahead of <body>), so it is excluded to keep the document structure
# intact.
src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro

# Prettier rewrites the tile fragment in a way the Astro compiler output
# does not round-trip cleanly; the file is kept in its hand-formatted shape.
src/components/scan/ResultsView.astro

# Markdown content is never run through Prettier: its Markdown pass rewrites
# emphasis inside identifiers, changes code samples whose point is their exact
# text, and re-indents front matter. The format globs already exclude .md; this
# keeps it that way for an ad-hoc `prettier --write .`.
src/content/
src/data/*.md
